<!bhtml 1>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>About · hello.biggle</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="logo.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <script src="hello.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="blobs" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  <main class="about">
    <p><a href="./" class="back">← Back to hello</a></p>
    <h1>About hello.biggle</h1>
    <p class="said" hidden>You typed: <strong id="said"></strong></p>
    <p>This was the very first site on the Bigglenet. It's a little folder of files: two <code>.bhtml</code> pages, a stylesheet, a script and a smiley.</p>

    <h2 id="rules">The rules of the Bigglenet</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Pages start with <code>&lt;!bhtml 1&gt;</code>, so they only open in Biggle.</li>
      <li>Scripts, styles and pictures only load from Biggle sites. No trackers, no ads.</li>
      <li>No cookies. Sites remember things with <code>biggle.storage</code>.</li>
    </ol>

    <form class="ask" action="about.bhtml">
      <label for="q">Say something to this page</label>
      <div>
        <input id="q" name="q" placeholder="Hi hello.biggle!">
        <button>Send</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <biggle-signed-in><p class="note">Signed in as <biggle-me></biggle-me>. Hi!</p></biggle-signed-in>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
